          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami Imana ikoranya ibicibwa bya Isirayeli iravuze iti “Nzongera kumukoraniriza abandi udashyizeho abe bakoranijwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwa nyamaswa zo mu gasozi mwese mwe, nimuze murye, namwe nyamaswa zo mu ishyamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarinzi be ni impumyi bose nta cyo bazi, bose ni nk'imbwa z'ibiragi zitabasha kumoka; bararota bakaryama bagakunda guhunikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni koko ni imbwa z'ibisambo zidahaga, ni abungeri batabasha kumenya, bose bateshuka inzira bajya mu yabo ubwabo, umuntu wese yishakira indamu mu buryo bwose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baravugana bati “Nimuze mbazanire vino tunywe ibishindisha tuvuyarare. N'ejo na ho bizaba bityo, bitagira akagero.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
